    <statement><p>Suppose <m>{ A_i  \ | \ i\in I }</m> is an indexed family of sets. For each statement below, write the letter of the equivalent symbolic form.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>B\subseteq \bigcap_{i\in I} A_i</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>B \subseteq (\bigcup_{i \in I} A_i)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>B \cap (\bigcap_{i \in I} A_i)\not = \emptyset</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
<p><ol label="A.">
<li>
<p><m>(\forall x \in B)(\exists i \in I)(x \in A_i)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>(\forall x \in B)(\forall i\in I)(x \in A_i)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>(\exists x \in B)(\forall i \in I) (x \in A_i)</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
